    "A couple of details make your plan fit better." : {
      "comment" : "Under the follow-up questions",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mit ein paar Angaben passt dein Plan noch besser zu dir."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un par de detalles ayudan a adaptar mejor tu plan."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Quelques détails pour mieux adapter ton plan."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bastano un paio di dettagli per adattare meglio il tuo piano."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "少し詳しく教えてもらうと、より合った学習計画を作れます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "몇 가지만 더 알려 주면 계획을 더 잘 맞출 수 있어요."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kilka szczegółów pomoże lepiej dopasować twój plan."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Alguns detalhes ajudam a ajustar seu plano."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Birkaç ayrıntıyla planın sana daha uygun olur."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A course in the Library fits your goal" : {
      "comment" : "Above a Library course that teaches the learner's goal",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ein Kurs in der Bibliothek passt zu deinem Ziel"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un curso de la Biblioteca se ajusta a tu objetivo"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un cours de la Bibliothèque correspond à ton objectif"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nella Biblioteca c’è un corso per il tuo obiettivo"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "目標に合うコースがライブラリにあります"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "라이브러리에 목표에 맞는 코스가 있어요"
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "W Bibliotece jest kurs, który pasuje do twojego celu"
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Um curso da Biblioteca combina com sua meta"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kütüphanede hedefine uygun bir kurs var"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A few quick questions about the %lld areas, so your plan skips what you already know. There's no score, and “I don't know yet” is a fine answer." : {
      "comment" : "What placement is for an exam with several areas",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Ein paar kurze Fragen zu dem %lld Bereich, damit dein Plan auslässt, was du schon weißt. Es gibt keinen Score, und „Ich weiß es noch nicht“ ist eine gute Antwort."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Ein paar kurze Fragen zu den %lld Bereichen, damit dein Plan auslässt, was du schon weißt. Es gibt keinen Score, und „Ich weiß es noch nicht“ ist eine gute Antwort."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "new",
                  "value" : "A few quick questions about the %lld area, so your plan skips what you already know. There's no score, and “I don't know yet” is a fine answer."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "new",
                  "value" : "A few quick questions about the %lld areas, so your plan skips what you already know. There's no score, and “I don't know yet” is a fine answer."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Unas preguntas rápidas sobre %lld área para que tu plan se salte lo que ya sabes. No hay puntaje y está bien responder “Aún no lo sé”."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Unas preguntas rápidas sobre %lld áreas para que tu plan se salte lo que ya sabes. No hay puntaje y está bien responder “Aún no lo sé”."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Quelques questions rapides sur %lld domaine pour que ton plan saute ce que tu sais déjà. Il n’y a pas de score, et tu peux tout à fait répondre « Je ne sais pas encore »."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Quelques questions rapides sur %lld domaines pour que ton plan saute ce que tu sais déjà. Il n’y a pas de score, et tu peux tout à fait répondre « Je ne sais pas encore »."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Qualche breve domanda su %lld area, così il tuo piano salta ciò che sai già. Non ci sono punteggi e va benissimo rispondere “Non lo so ancora”."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Qualche breve domanda su %lld aree, così il tuo piano salta ciò che sai già. Non ci sono punteggi e va benissimo rispondere “Non lo so ancora”."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "%lld分野について短い問題をいくつか出し、すでに知っている内容を学習計画でスキップできるようにします。点数はつきません。「まだわかりません」と答えても大丈夫です。"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "간단한 문제 몇 개로 %lld개 영역에서 이미 아는 내용을 확인하고, 계획에서 건너뛰어요. 점수는 매기지 않고, “아직 모르겠어요”라고 답해도 괜찮아요."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "few" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Kilka krótkich pytań o %lld obszary, żeby twój plan pomijał to, co już znasz. Nie ma punktacji, a „Jeszcze nie wiem” to dobra odpowiedź."
                }
              },
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Kilka krótkich pytań o %lld obszar, żeby twój plan pomijał to, co już znasz. Nie ma punktacji, a „Jeszcze nie wiem” to dobra odpowiedź."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Kilka krótkich pytań o %lld obszarów, żeby twój plan pomijał to, co już znasz. Nie ma punktacji, a „Jeszcze nie wiem” to dobra odpowiedź."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
