    "The exam has %lld choices to make. Your plan and mocks follow your picks, and you can change them in your plan." : {
      "comment" : "Under the exam choice question, for several choices",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Für die Prüfung musst du %lld Entscheidung treffen. Dein Plan und deine Probeprüfungen richten sich nach deiner Auswahl, die du in deinem Plan ändern kannst."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
