    "The plan covers what that role needs on day one." : {
      "comment" : "Under the career change question",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Plan deckt ab, was du für diese Rolle von Anfang an brauchst."
